  "sourceTitle": "Mediterranean Pasta",
  "sourceText": "Mediterranean Pasta\nBy: Anonymous\nPublished: Tuesday, December 1, 2009 - 11:30pm\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n4 cups chopped tomato\n1 tablespoon olive oil\n1 tablespoon red wine vinegar\n2 tablespoons chopped fresh basil\n1/4 teaspoon salt\n1/8 teaspoon crushed red pepper\n1 clove garlic, minced\n4 cups cooked angel hair pasta\ncooked without salt or fat\n1/4 cup crumbled feta cheese, (1 ounce)\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Combine first 7 ingredients in a bowl, and stir well. Let stand 10 minutes. 2 Yield: 4 servings (serving size: 1 cup tomato mixture, 1 cup pasta, and 1 tablespoon cheese).",
